<title>UK: BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Sudirman Cup world</p>
<p>team championships on Saturday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p> China    5    South Korea    0</p>
<p>Results (Chinese names first):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Dong Jiong beat Park Sung-woo 15-9 15-11</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Lin Liwen/Chen Xingdong beat Kang Kyung-jin/Ha Tae-kwon 15-7</p>
<p>15-2</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao beat Lee Joo-hyun 11-2 11-7</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p> Ge Fei/Gu Jun beat Ra Kyung-min/Kim Shin-young 15-7   15-10</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Liu Yong/Ge beat Kim Dong-moon/Ra Kyung-min 15-7 15-8</p>
<p>Group 2 promotion play-off</p>
<p> Malaysia   3    Germany    2</p>
<p>Results (Malaysian names first):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Ong Ewe Hock beat O.Pongratz 3-3, retired hurt</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Cheah Soon Kit/Yap Kim Hock beat M.Helber/B.Siegemund 15-10</p>
<p>15-13</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Law Pei Pei beat H.Schonharting 12-10 11-6</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Lim Pek Siah/Chor Hooi Yee lost to K.Stechmann/K.Ubben 7-15</p>
<p>15-10 8-15</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Cheah Soon Kit/Lim Pek Siah lost to M.Keck/K.Stechmann 15-8</p>
<p>11-15 7-15.</p>
<p>Group 2 play-off</p>
<p> Thailand   3   Canada	2</p>
<p>Group 3 play-offs</p>
<p> India	4   Finland     1</p>
<p> Norway     4   Austria     1</p>
<p> Hong Kong  3   New Zealand 2</p>
</text>
